note as CONCURRENCY_diagram_25_pharmacy_inventory
  CONCURRENCY CONTRACT
  1. Lock the exact stock-position rows with SELECT ... FOR UPDATE.
  2. Recalculate available quantity inside the transaction.
  3. Reject negative availability; write ledger and projection atomically.
  4. Enforce unique idempotency keys per pharmacy/source operation.
  5. Retry serialization failures with bounded backoff.
  6. Use SKIP LOCKED only for queue workers, never to decide patient stock.
  7. Expired reservations are released by an idempotent persistent worker.
end note

