note as FLOW_diagram_25b_pharmacy_supply_dispensing
  RECEIVING AND DISPENSING
  Procurement/receiving and patient dispensing create immutable inventory
  ledger entries in the same database transaction as their operational record.
  External sync never overwrites stock directly; discrepancies become
  reconciliation items requiring a governed resolution.
end note



