note as PHARMACY_ERP_BRIDGE
  Pharmacy inventory remains specialized for lot/serial/dispensing control, but its
  supplier, purchase-order and receipt records are explicitly linked to the central ERP
  document flow. Inventory movements can be reconciled to the exact ERP receipt item and
  accounting ledger line without relying only on a polymorphic source_id.
end note

